@@ -2,3 +2,9 @@
 
 Verify the provider signature before applying an order update.
 A successful delivery receives HTTP 204.
+
+## Retries and retention
+
+Deliveries are identified by the provider event ID. Replayed events
+receive HTTP 204 without applying the payment a second time.
+Keep delivery receipts for 30 days.
